      "Doc Lin's sticky note, pressed to the lid, is rushed but clear: for a burn, cool it under clean water, and do not pop the blisters. Doc Lin underlined the second part twice. On the side of the kit, someone has written a promise in marker: one kit gets you back on your feet.",
