      "A sticky note clings to the cold steel with a realistic warning: a plate stops grabbing hands, not crashes. Drive accordingly. Along one edge, someone has drawn a neat row of marker lines that count every dent it has taken. There are a great many lines. The plate, somehow, is still here.",
